    "body": "Worth highlighting two additional properties of this proposal:\n\n- **Zero new API surface:** No new methods, events, or permissions. The behavior builds entirely on existing `<a download>` and drag data store semantics.\n- **Web/native parity:** Native apps can act as file drag sources. Web apps currently cannot — dragging a link only produces a URL, not a File. This proposal closes that gap for the case where the content is already local (blob/data URLs).",
